{"strongs": "H4553", "word": "מִסְפֵּד", "translit": "mis.ped", "root": "ספד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "wailing", "definition": "מִסְפֵּד noun masculine Gen 50:10 wailing ; — absolute ׳ מ Amos 5:16 + 11 t.; construct מִסְפַּד Mic 1:11 + 2 t.; suffix מִסְפְּדִי Ps 30:12 — wailing: 1. for dead, Gen 50:10 ( J ; as accusative of congnate meaning with verb), Zech 12:10 (with עַלֿ ; compare v Zech 12:11 v Zech 12:11 below). 2. for calamity experienced Amos 5:16 (twice in verse) (|| אֵבֶל ), v Amos 5:17 ; Mic 1:8 ( כַּתַּנִּים ׳ מ , || אֵבֶל ), v Mic 1:11 ; Jer 48:38 ; Ezek 27:31 , anticipated Jer 6:26 ; Esth 4:3 . 3. in contrition Isa 22:12 (+ בְּכִי ), Joel 2:12 (+ צוֺם , בְּכִי ), compare Zech 12:11 (twice in verse). 4. in general, Ps 30:12 (opposed to מָחוֺל , compare Eccl 3:4 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5669')\">BDB5669</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4553')\">H4553</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5668')\">BDB5668</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5670')\">BDB5670</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִסְפֵּד</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 50:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,10)\">Gen 50:10</ref></sup> <highlightword>wailing</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:16\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,16)\">Amos 5:16</ref> + 11 t.; construct <bdbheb>מִסְפַּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 1:11\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,11)\">Mic 1:11</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מִסְפְּדִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 30:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,30,12)\">Ps 30:12</ref> — <highlight>wailing:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> for dead, <ref ref=\"Gen 50:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bc