=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,12)\">Joel 2:12</ref> (+ <bdbheb>צוֺם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בְּכִי</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Zech 12:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,12,11)\">Zech 12:11</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> in general, <ref ref=\"Ps 30:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,30,12)\">Ps 30:12</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מָחוֺל</bdbheb>, compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,4)\">Eccl 3:4</ref>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 50:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 50, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Amos 5:16", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 5, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Mic 1:11", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 1, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 30:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 30, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Zech 12:10", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Zech 12:11", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 12, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Amos 5:17", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 5, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Mic 1:8", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 1, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Jer 48:38", "book": "JER", "chapter": 48, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "Ezek 27:31", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 27, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Jer 6:26", "book": "JER", "chapter": 6, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Esth 4:3", "book": "EST", "chapter": 4, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 22:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Joel 2:12", "book": "JOL", "chapter": 2, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Eccl 3:4", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 3, "verse": 4}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מִסְפֵּד", "׳", "מ", "מִסְפַּד", "מִסְפְּדִי", "עַלֿ", "אֵבֶל", "כַּתַּנִּים", "בְּכִי", "צוֺם", "מָחוֺל"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["J"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB5669", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}